OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSATwo men convicted of #137k watch
OL,4,Atheft
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been found guilty of
OL,7,Frobbing a fashion designer of his
OL,8,F#137,000 Richard Mille watch, which was
OL,9,Fcut from his wrist as he left a Mayfair
OL,10,Frestaurant.
OL,12,FAli Eldahouzze, 22, and Abdel El
OL,13,FHabchi, 30, were part of a plot to
OL,14,Ftarget Romanian entrepreneur Catalin
OL,15,FBotezatu in Berkeley Square just before
OL,16,Fmidnight on 28 January.
OL,18,FBotezatu described how he was pushed
OL,19,Fand confronted by the thieves, and told
OL,20,FSouthwark Crown Court: "I feared for my
OL,21,Flife."
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
