OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSATwo men convicted of #137k watch
OL,4,Atheft
OL,5,
OL,6,FLead robber Younes Djoudi pleaded
OL,7,Fguilty before trial. Eldahouzze and El
OL,8,FHabchi claimed they did not know the
OL,9,Frobbery was about to take place and
OL,10,Fwere in fear of reprisals from Djoudi.
OL,11,FA jury convicted them both of robbery
OL,12,Fafter a nine-day trial.
